 id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" href=\"?note=fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction\">14-thm-sheafification-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\)</span> (sheafification adjunction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" href=\"?note=fd713aec6d1a8dd1\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction\">14-thm-sheafification-adjunction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\)</span> (diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\)</span> (limit-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>固定小站点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为包含函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为小范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\bigl(i(L),(i(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},i\\circ D\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\bigl(i(L),(i(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},i\\circ D\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.4 Proposition 4、III.6 公式 (2)，印刷页 128、134；DjVu 第 70、73 图页。</p>\n<p>包含函子是层化的右伴随，直接应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e937528586d5f172\" href=\"?note=e937528586d5f172\" title=\"14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits\">14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits</a>。逐点极限的层条件也可验证：每个分量的唯一粘合与图中的态射相容，由极限的唯一性得到整体粘合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits","status":"resolved","id":"e937528586d5f172","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-right-adjoints-preserve-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"fd713aec6d1a8dd1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"1