in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},i\\circ D\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1830,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-inclusion-preserves-small-limits|Theorem — Inclusion of Sheaves Preserves Small Limits]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-inclusion-preserves-small-limits]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-inclusion-preserves-small-limits]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-inclusion-preserves-small-limits]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-inclusion-preserves-small-limits|Theorem — Inclusion of Sheaves Preserves Small Limits]]"},{"id":"68f3350ee8219486","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对子层 $A$，特征筛包含恒等箭头恰当且仅当 $x\\in A(C)$；筛包含恒等箭头即为最大筛，所以所写方块逐点为拉回。[[14-thm-sheaf-inclusion-preserves-small-limits]]保证层的极限按预层计算。若另一自然变换 $\\theta:F\\to\\Omega_J$ 给同一拉回，则\n$f\\in\\theta_C(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{id}_D\\in\\theta_D(F(f)x)\\Longleftrightarrow F(f)x\\in A(D)$，故 $\\theta=\\chi_A^J$。任意单态射与其逐点像子层同构，于是覆盖全部子对象。原书 III.7 Lemmas 1–2、Proposition 3 的证明已按图76–77逐项比对；这里是本库编码下的重述，无机器证明声明。"}],"outgoing":["dad26c5de724390a","e937528586d5f172","300365f146cacc8a","e21364f5dcced9e7","5036bba7ca747e71","28211adc1b0ce5bc","fd713aec6d1a8dd1","55bd5d1a324171ab","1f1269584b34ad4b"]}